wn, so they never vanish into the floor. **Combat**","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T03:22:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656384782","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4918080-1844751498232906","game_id":"steam-4918080","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.1.10 — bosses that change shape, a clock on every attack, and shops","summary":"**One full boss fight, as it plays.** A potato, a hamster, a carrot and a pea against Beetrixthe Polished. The hero and the song are a player's own, the boss was built in the bossdesigner that ships with the game: **Boss fights**- A boss can change shape in the middle of a fight: a stage can bring its own sprite and its own size.- In The Adversary, every ability can be put on the Kairos clock. It lands after real seconds, whoever's turn it is, and you stop time, slow it, or flatten it back onto ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T01:36:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498232906","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4918080-1844751498218758","game_id":"steam-4918080","kind":"announcement","title":"The Campaign Forge demo is live — forge your first world today","summary":"The demo is out, and it is the real thing. Three acts, all free: Play immediately — The Ember Road. A small hand-crafted opening chapter, playablethe moment the demo loads. Pick your class, land at Brackwater with wet bootsand no plans, and find out why the beacon went dark. No setup, no waiting. Forge your own world. The generator itself, running entirely on your PCwith the bundled local AI. No account, no API key, no cloud. Answer a fewquestions — or type a single lazy idea and let the forge e","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T15:16:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218758","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4918080-1842846814442841","game_id":"steam-4918080","kind":"announcement","title":"Campaign Forge launches November 27 - and there's a free demo on the way","summary":"The short version: Campaign Forge enters Early Access on November 27, 2026 —a bit later than the August window we first posted. The reason: something better landed on the calendar. Campaign Forge willbe part of Steam Next Fest in October, and before that the Party-Based RPGFest (September 14–21) — and both deserve a proper, playable demo rather than arushed launch. The extra weeks go into exactly the build you'll play first. The free demo arrives in September, in three acts: - Play immediately —","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T10:11:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814442841","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4918080-1837955055365133","game_id":"steam-4918080","kind":"announcement","title":"Campaign Forge is now wishlistable — Early Access arrives August 2026 ⚒️","summary":"Most RPGs end. Yours doesn't.Campaign Forge is an Infinite Story RPG: create a world, a hero, and a party woven into the world by name — then steer a curated, chapter-by-chapter campaign an AI co-author builds around your choices. Generate the next chapter whenever you want; the world remembers everything you do.What's waiting inside: • An endless, curated campaign — your party written into the world's regions, factions, and central conflict, and a world that treats your oaths, deaths, and betra","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T04:43:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055365133","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4918080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:57Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:57Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4918080":"2026-10-26T05:11:57Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4918080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:57Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5211890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:57Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:11:57Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4918080","app_id":4918080,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"7d3b6863648237511b4640680c3049bbbe30651bfb2395a8e3dabb181d361589","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Infinity grows - Your story never ends. Create worlds, heroes, and play your legends chapter by chapter. Fight, explore, and shape a world that remembers you and your Party. Generate it free and fully offline, then change it how you want. \r\nCampaign Forge - The 2D Infinite Story RPG.","publishers":[{"name":"Daedalus"}],"developers":[{"name":"Daedalus"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1795791600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Campaign Forge - Official Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1783991399","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"